          "start_ms": 46880,
          "end_ms": 48880
        },
        {
          "text": "I am the nobody, the nobody",
          "start_ms": 48880,
          "end_ms": 51040
        },
        {
          "text": "Now watch me while I am running",
          "start_ms": 51040,
          "end_ms": 53520
        },
        {
          "text": "Everything in me celebrates",
          "start_ms": 53520,
          "end_ms": 55680
        },
        {
          "text": "I can not hold it in, I will not hold it back",
          "start_ms": 55680,
          "end_ms": 59280
        },
        {
          "text": "I am the nobody, the nobody",
          "start_ms": 59280,
          "end_ms": 61440
        },
        {
          "text": "And I am never going back",
          "start_ms": 61440,
          "end_ms": 63440
        }
      ],
      "start_ms": 44720,
      "end_ms": 63440
    },
    {
      "type": "verse",
      "label": "Verse 2",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The proud ones walking tall, so sure",
          "start_ms": 66440,
          "end_ms": 69320
        },
        {
          "text": "But they do not know what is coming for them",
          "start_ms": 69320,
          "end_ms": 72840
        },
        {
          "text": "Scattered like leaves when the wind hits hard",
          "start_ms": 72840,
          "end_ms": 76440
        },
        {
          "text": "The ones who thought they held the cards",
          "start_ms": 76440,
          "end_ms": 79640
        },
        {
          "text": "The thrones they built are coming down",
          "start_ms": 79640,
          "end_ms": 82680
        },
        {
          "text": "The small ones rising off the ground",
          "start_ms": 82680,
          "end_ms": 85560
        },
        {
          "text": "The hungry finally getting fed",
          "start_ms": 85560,
          "end_ms": 87960
        },
        {
          "text": "The rich left empty-handed instead",
          "start_ms": 87960,
          "end_ms": 90680
